  "content": "```python\ndef earliest_arrival(n: int, connections: list[tuple[int, int, int, int]], source: int, target: int, start: int, change: int, max_transfers: int) -> int:\n    if source == target:\n        return start\n\n    infinity = 1 << 60\n    best = [infinity] * n\n\n    # 1 本目: source から start 以降に出る便（乗り換え時間は要らない）\n    for from_station, to_station, depart, arrive in connections:\n        if from_station == source and depart >= start and arrive < best[to_station]:\n            best[to_station] = arrive\n\n    # 2 本目以降: 直前までの「最大 k 本での最早到着」から、乗り換え時間を足して乗れる便だけを緩和する\n    for _ in range(max_transfers):\n        updated = best[:]\n        changed = False\n        for from_station, to_station, depart, arrive in connections:\n            if best[from_station] + change <= depart and arrive < updated[to_station]:\n                updated[to_station] = arrive\n                changed = True\n        if not changed:\n            break\n        best = updated\n\n    answer = best[target]\n    return answer if answer < infinity else -1\n```",
